    <h1 class="section-title">Wellness &amp; Benefits of Running</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Few things give so much for so little. Beyond exercise, running is a way to care for
      your body and mind at the same time. A few kilometres a week are linked to
      less stress, better sleep and a healthier heart.
    </p>
    <p class="page-updated">Last updated: October 28, 2026 · <a href="#sources">Sources</a></p>

